### Case: forged-token — a structurally valid JWT this gateway did not sign.
### Expect 401. A 200 here means the route is not verifying signatures at all,
### which is the most serious way this solution can fail.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/orders
authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJmb3JnZWQifQ.not-a-valid-signature
accept: application/json
